        <div class="AccentCardDiv">
            <p class="t3">Overview</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cardDiv">
            <p>LWMS is short for <b>L</b>ight<b>W</b>eight <b>M</b>anaged <b>S</b>erver.</p>
            <p>This software is designed to implement a server that administrator can controll almost all stage of the
                server through pipelines and manage commands.</p>
            <p>This server provide following pipeline process units by default:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>DefaultStaticFileUnit - Directly send requested file.</li>
                <li>DefaultStreamProcessUnit - Directly write data to the output stream.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Following pipeline units are embeded with the pipeline:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>LogUnit - Registered before all pipeline units to log requests</li>
                <li>ErrorResponseUnit - Registered after all units to send http error message and pages such as send
                    code 404 and 404 page when all units cannot handle one request</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
